# Summary

Sales grew steadily over the quarter across all three regions.

# Data

| Region | Q1 | Q2 |
| ------ | -- | -- |
| North  | 12 | 18 |
| South  | 9  | 14 |
| West   | 15 | 21 |

# Methods

Growth rates were computed as the relative change between quarters.

# Conclusion

The West region shows the strongest absolute growth.
